@page "/faq"

<PageTitle>FAQ — Learning Desk</PageTitle>

<div class="page">
    <div class="sectionhead">
        <div class="eyebrow">FAQ</div>
        <h2>Common questions</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="empty">
        <h3>Where is my data stored?</h3>
        <p class="muted">
            In the application's own PostgreSQL database, scoped to your account, so it follows you
            between devices. Only your theme choice stays in this browser.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="empty">
        <h3>Do videos play inside the page?</h3>
        <p class="muted">Yes. Unlike the prototype, this app can embed players directly.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="empty">
        <h3>Can I start over?</h3>
        <p class="muted">
            Resetting clears the notes, ticks and scores for one subject, leaving your account intact.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>
